serpantinum (ilyamiro) — AGPL-3.0 — https://github.com/ilyamiro/serpantinum

    This shell is a port of serpantinum, and later of its v2 rewrite, to KDE
    Plasma 6 / Wayland. Most panels, the reusable controls, the Settings look,
    the theme presets and the UI sound effects derive from its QML and assets.
    Originally taken at commit 5d4451f ("Serpantinum announcement", 2026-08-08).

