Niri shaders (liixini) — MIT — https://github.com/liixini/shaders

    The bodies under plasma/org.serpantinum.wallpaper/contents/shaders/niri/ are each
    effect's close.glsl, vendored verbatim; our prelude supplies Niri's shader interface
    and the postlude composites the closing wallpaper over the incoming one. glass-warp
    has its missing closing brace added, an upstream typo, and dissolve's sweep is widened
    from 1.6 to 1.7 so its last corner clears before the end.

